RTX 6000 Ada PICK	Ada	48GB GDDR6 ECC	~960 GB/s	~0.70 $/hr	Good	Workstation card, full CUDA stack, 5-yr warranty; NVLink pairs two → 96GB = the path up to GLM-5-class. The pick for "intelligence on one card."
